                       "number":  86,
                       "subVerseIndex":  0,
                       "paragraphNumber":  0,
                       "paragraphIndex":  0,
                       "text":  "Then Jonathan left there and encamped at Askalon, and the people of that city came out to meet him with great pomp.",
